# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/events/expansion_classes.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@event core_flying_lesson
# en: Compulsory Broom Flight
title [014809] = 必修飞帚课
# en: Compulsory first-year broom flight. The instructor blows her whistle. Your broom rises, hesitates, and then — clearly having taken a dislike to you — begins drifting toward the lake.
text [d69dcf] = 一年级必修的飞帚课。教练吹响了哨子。你的扫帚升起来，犹豫了一下，然后——显然是不太喜欢你——开始往湖那边飘。
# en: A row of nervous first-years standing beside brooms on the lawn, one broom already rising on its own, an instructor with a whistle.
scene [40aef9] = 草坪上一排紧张的一年级生站在扫帚旁，其中一把已经自己飞了起来，教练手里拿着哨子。
# en: Hold on and steer it back (Vigor)
opt.left.label [df8a8f] = 抓紧，把它拽回来（体魄）
# en: You wrestle it round and land, wobbling, exactly on the mark. The instructor nods. The broom grudgingly accepts you.
opt.left.say.1 [9f0eb8] = 你硬是把它扳了回来，摇摇晃晃地正好落在标记上。教练点了点头。扫帚勉强认了你。
# en: The broom wins. You land in the shallows. Everyone sees. Everyone remembers.
opt.left.say.2 [ccfc57] = 扫帚赢了。你落进了浅水里。所有人都看见了。所有人都记住了。
# en: Jump off while it's still low
opt.right.label [c7b2ec] = 趁它还飞得低跳下来
# en: You drop four feet onto the grass. Undignified, but dry. The broom carries on to the lake alone and sinks with a sulky gurgle.
opt.right.say.1 [ce5e6e] = 你从四英尺高的地方跳到草地上。不太体面，但没湿。扫帚独自飞到湖上，咕嘟一声闷闷不乐地沉了下去。

@event pyro_dragon_breath
# en: A Sample of Dragonfire
title [8d15de] = 一缕龙焰样本
# en: Thorne holds up a sealed jar containing one flame of genuine dragonfire, blue-white and furious. "Who would like to try holding it?" he asks. Nobody moves. He looks at you.
text [d3969c] = 索恩举起一个密封的罐子，里面是一团货真价实的龙焰，蓝白色，怒气冲冲。“谁想试着捧一下？”他问。没人动。他看向了你。
# en: A glass jar containing a single writhing flame of deep blue, held in tongs by a stern professor, students leaning back from it.
scene [5714c4] = 一个玻璃罐里扭动着一团深蓝色的火焰，被一位严厉的教授用钳子夹着，学生们纷纷往后仰。
# en: Hold it (Arcana)
opt.left.label [6815be] = 捧住它（奥术）
# en: It sears and struggles and then, astonishingly, settles in your palm like a small warm animal. The class stares. Thorne almost smiles.
opt.left.say.1 [1f13d1] = 它灼烧着、挣扎着，然后——令人震惊地——像一只温暖的小动物一样在你掌心安顿下来。全班都看呆了。索恩差点笑了。
# en: The dragonfire disagrees. You spend a week with bandaged hands and a new respect for dragons.
opt.left.say.2 [77f691] = 龙焰不同意。你缠着绷带过了一个星期，对龙有了全新的敬意。
# en: Watch someone else
opt.right.label [1e1e35] = 看别人来
# en: A fifth-year volunteers and loses a sleeve. You take careful notes on what not to do.
opt.right.say.1 [ba7fb7] = 一个五年级生自告奋勇，结果烧掉了一只袖子。你仔细记下了哪些事不该做。

@event tide_water_spirit_race
# en: The Water Spirit Race
title [da1049] = 水灵竞速
# en: Professor Marisol's final challenge: swim the lake while the water spirits race you. "They cheat," she says cheerfully. "Ask them nicely not to."
text [2365f2] = 玛丽索尔教授的期末挑战：游过湖去，同时有水灵和你比赛。“它们会作弊，”她兴高采烈地说，“好好请它们别作弊。”
# en: Students swimming across a lake at dawn, translucent water-spirits racing alongside them like silver dolphins.
scene [561442] = 黎明时分，学生们游过湖面，半透明的水灵像银色海豚一样在他们身旁竞速。
# en: Race them flat out (Vigor)
opt.left.label [1c964f] = 全力和它们比（体魄）
# en: You touch the far shore a hand's length ahead of the fastest spirit. It sulks, then laughs like a fountain.
opt.left.say.1 [5f4a18] = 你比最快的那个水灵早一掌的距离摸到对岸。它生了会儿闷气，然后像喷泉一样笑了起来。
# en: The spirits tow you in circles. You arrive last, but very clean.
opt.left.say.2 [320621] = 水灵拖着你转圈圈。你最后一个到，不过洗得非常干净。
# en: Ask them nicely
opt.right.label [a2f34a] = 好好请求它们
# en: You ask. They carry you across on their backs like a raft. Marisol says that counts. Marisol says it's the whole point.
opt.right.say.1 [c7d0ee] = 你开口请求。它们像木筏一样把你驮了过去。玛丽索尔说这算数。玛丽索尔说这才是重点。
# en: They pretend not to hear. Water spirits are terrible at manners.
opt.right.say.2 [eac302] = 它们假装没听见。水灵最不讲礼貌了。

@event illusion_mirror_maze
# en: The Mirror Maze Exam
title [55c841] = 镜之迷宫考试
# en: Professor Vey's exam: a maze of enchanted mirrors. Find the exit. Some reflections lie. One of them is — she promises — the real you.
text [0aec9f] = 维伊教授的考试：一座魔法镜子组成的迷宫。找到出口。有些倒影会说谎。其中一个——她保证——是真正的你。
# en: A maze of tall mirrors in a dark hall, each reflecting a different version of the same student, one reflection grinning.
scene [b9068c] = 黑暗大厅里的高镜迷宫，每面镜子都映出同一个学生的不同模样，其中一个倒影在咧嘴笑。
# en: Trust your own eyes (Guile)
opt.left.label [b1b6ad] = 相信自己的眼睛（诡计）
# en: You spot the reflection that blinks late, and follow it out. Vey awards top marks and says, "Most people trust the one that looks happiest."
opt.left.say.1 [f97c79] = 你发现了那个眨眼慢半拍的倒影，跟着它走了出去。维伊给了你最高分，说：“大多数人都相信看起来最开心的那个。”
# en: You follow the happiest reflection for an hour. It leads you in a circle and waves goodbye.
opt.left.say.2 [21a1ac] = 你跟着最开心的那个倒影走了一个钟头。它领你绕了一圈，然后挥手道别。
# en: Shatter the illusion (Arcana)
opt.right.label [c01679] = 击碎幻象（奥术）
# en: Every mirror goes dark at once. Exit found. Vey writes, "Effective. Inelegant. Pass."
opt.right.say.1 [137f22] = 所有镜子同时暗了下去。出口找到了。维伊写道：“有效。不优雅。及格。”
# en: You shatter one mirror. It was real. Seven years of bad luck, the caretaker says, or two crowns for the glass.
opt.right.say.2 [c9ca74] = 你击碎了一面镜子。它是真的。管理员说，要么倒霉七年，要么赔两克朗玻璃钱。

@event alch_love_potion
# en: The Love Potion Assignment
title [d13e1c] = 爱情药水作业
# en: This week's assignment: brew a love potion — "for analytical purposes only". Your flask glows a suspicious pink. Someone at the next bench asks if they can buy it. Several people ask.
text [3c39e1] = 本周作业：调制一剂爱情药水——“仅供分析之用”。你的烧瓶泛着可疑的粉光。隔壁桌有人问能不能买下来。好几个人都问了。
# en: A pink, glittering potion in a heart-shaped flask on a workbench, a student holding it up to the light with a doubtful expression.
scene [1a4005] = 工作台上一个心形烧瓶里装着闪亮的粉色药水，一名学生把它举到光下，满脸怀疑。
# en: Brew it perfectly, then pour it away
opt.left.label [8fa0a2] = 完美调好，然后倒掉
# en: Perfect colour, perfect scent. You pour it down the sink. The pipes are affectionate for a week.
opt.left.say.1 [d421ab] = 完美的颜色，完美的香气。你把它倒进了水槽。水管一整个星期都含情脉脉的。
# en: Sell it
opt.right.label [4ac442] = 卖掉它
# en: A prefect falls in love with the headmistress's portrait. It's traced back to you. Worth it, almost.
opt.right.say.1 [1f1132] = 一位级长爱上了院长的画像。追查下来找到了你。差不多值了。
# en: Twenty crowns. You never ask what it was used for. You see a lot of unusual couples at dinner.
opt.right.say.2 [6a856a] = 二十克朗。你从没问过它被用来干什么。你在晚餐时看到了很多不寻常的情侣。

@event div_prophecy_exam
# en: The Prophecy Exam
title [fa5039] = 预言考试
# en: The final Divination exam: gaze into the crystal and make one prophecy about the coming month. The examiner will check. "Vague prophecies," she warns, "fail."
text [891acd] = 占卜学期末考试：凝视水晶球，对下个月做出一条预言。考官会核实。“含糊的预言，”她警告道，“不及格。”
# en: A dim divination classroom, a single student staring into a crystal ball, the examiner's quill hovering expectantly over a blank page.
scene [91fdd6] = 昏暗的占卜教室，一名学生独自凝视着水晶球，考官的羽毛笔悬在空白的纸上，满怀期待。
# en: Make a bold, specific prophecy
opt.left.label [d1a2b7] = 做一个大胆而具体的预言
# en: "On the eighth, the kitchen cat will have kittens in the headmistress's hat." On the eighth, she does. You pass with distinction.
opt.left.say.1 [014f80] = “八号那天，厨房的猫会在院长的帽子里生小猫。”八号那天，它真的生了。你以优异成绩通过。
# en: "On the eighth, it will snow indoors." It does not snow indoors. The examiner writes "ambitious".
opt.left.say.2 [fc7167] = “八号那天，室内会下雪。”室内并没有下雪。考官写下“有野心”。
# en: Make a careful, safe prophecy
opt.right.label [e30df1] = 做一个谨慎稳妥的预言
# en: "Someone will be late to breakfast." Someone is. The examiner sighs and gives you a pass.
opt.right.say.1 [c07160] = “有人早饭会迟到。”确实有人迟到了。考官叹了口气，给你打了及格。

@event art_golem_helper
# en: The Little Golem
title [6f3f24] = 小魔像
# en: Your term project: a knee-high clay golem that carries books. It works! It works so well that it has started carrying everyone's books, whether they want it to or not.
text [677080] = 你的学期作业：一个及膝高的黏土魔像，专门搬书。它成功了！成功得过了头，开始搬所有人的书，不管人家愿不愿意。
# en: A knee-high clay golem carrying a teetering stack of books across a classroom, a student watching anxiously as it nears a staircase.
scene [4ac493] = 一个及膝高的黏土魔像抱着一摞摇摇欲坠的书穿过教室，一名学生紧张地看着它走近楼梯。
# en: Add a "stop" command (Lore)
opt.left.label [fb0cbb] = 加一个“停下”指令（学识）
# en: The golem stops. It also waits politely. The professor asks if she can borrow it for her office.
opt.left.say.1 [6ad2e4] = 魔像停下了，还会礼貌地等待。教授问能不能借去她的办公室用。
# en: Now it stops randomly, mid-staircase, holding forty books. Nobody can get past it. It looks very pleased.
opt.left.say.2 [d28e81] = 现在它会随机停下——在楼梯中间，抱着四十本书。谁也过不去。它看起来非常得意。
# en: Let it roam free
opt.right.label [d4c542] = 让它自由游荡
# en: The golem becomes a beloved castle fixture, delivering books to whoever looks sad. Nobody knows who made it. You know.
opt.right.say.1 [2577fe] = 魔像成了城堡里人见人爱的一景，专给看起来难过的人送书。没人知道是谁造的。你知道。

@event beast_hippocampus
# en: The Hippocampus Foal
title [21cc8d] = 小海马驹
# en: A hippocampus foal — half pony, half fish — has been stranded in a shrinking rock pool on the lakeshore. Professor Brask is on the other side of the grounds. The foal is panicking.
text [4890ea] = 一只海马驹——半是小马，半是鱼——被困在湖边一个不断缩小的石潭里。布拉斯克教授在校园另一头。小马驹惊慌失措。
# en: A tiny sea-horse foal with a fish's tail struggling in a rock pool on the lake shore, a student kneeling beside the water.
scene [205918] = 湖边石潭里，一只长着鱼尾的小海马驹在挣扎，一名学生跪在水边。
# en: Carry it to the lake (Vigor)
opt.left.label [28007e] = 把它抱回湖里（体魄）
# en: It thrashes, then trusts you. You wade out and let it go. It circles you three times before diving deep.
opt.left.say.1 [4d71d5] = 它扑腾了一阵，然后信任了你。你蹚进水里放开它。它绕着你转了三圈，然后潜入深处。
# en: It kicks you in the stomach with surprising force — but you get it to the water. Brask says that's how they say thank you.
opt.left.say.2 [7f1482] = 它力气大得惊人地踢中了你的肚子——但你还是把它送回了水里。布拉斯克说，它们就是这样道谢的。
# en: Run for Professor Brask
opt.right.label [cb87c9] = 跑去找布拉斯克教授
# en: Brask arrives with a bucket and a lullaby. She makes you hold the bucket. You learn more in ten minutes than in a whole term.
opt.right.say.1 [07b643] = 布拉斯克带着一只水桶和一首摇篮曲赶来了。她让你拎着水桶。你在十分钟里学到的比一整个学期还多。

@event astro_eclipse
# en: The Eclipse
title [deb525] = 日食
# en: An eclipse, the first in forty years. The astromancy class is on the roof with smoked-glass lenses. At the moment of totality, you notice something the charts don't show: a second shadow, smaller, moving the wrong way.
text [1ca60e] = 一场日食，四十年来的第一次。星象学课的学生们拿着烟熏玻璃镜片站在屋顶上。全食的那一刻，你注意到了星图上没有的东西：第二道阴影，更小，朝着相反的方向移动。
# en: A black disc sliding across the sun above the observatory dome, students on the roof with smoked-glass lenses, a halo of light around the darkness.
scene [5b724a] = 天文台穹顶上方，一个黑色圆盘滑过太阳，屋顶上的学生们举着烟熏玻璃镜片，黑暗周围一圈光晕。
# en: Record it precisely
opt.left.label [ee9627] = 精确记录下来
# en: You chart the second shadow's path exactly. It crosses the sky and stops — directly above the lake.
opt.left.say.1 [07b204] = 你精确地画出了第二道阴影的轨迹。它划过天空，停了下来——正好停在湖的上方。
# en: Just watch the eclipse
opt.right.label [b5b48a] = 只是看日食
# en: For four minutes the world holds its breath. You'll remember the cold, and the silence, and the strange birdsong, for the rest of your life.
opt.right.say.1 [3ab28b] = 有四分钟，整个世界屏住了呼吸。你这辈子都会记得那份寒冷、那份寂静，还有那奇怪的鸟鸣。

@event heal_triage_drill
# en: Triage
title [090621] = 伤员分诊
# en: Sister Amaranth's triage drill: twelve "injured" students, one healer — you — and ten minutes. Some are faking worse than others. One, you realise, is genuinely hurt.
text [c92712] = 阿玛兰斯修女的分诊演练：十二个“受伤”的学生，一个治疗师——就是你——还有十分钟。有些人装得比别人更夸张。而有一个，你意识到，是真的受伤了。
# en: A practice ward full of students acting injured, groaning theatrically on cots, a single student healer in the middle with a clipboard.
scene [5bb9f0] = 一间练习病房里满是假装受伤的学生，在病床上夸张地呻吟，一名学生治疗师拿着记录板站在中间。
# en: Treat the genuine injury first
opt.left.label [ab25ba] = 先处理真正的伤
# en: You spot the real injury in the first minute. Amaranth nods, once, which is the highest honour in the infirmary.
opt.left.say.1 [ac5815] = 你在第一分钟就发现了真正的伤员。阿玛兰斯点了一下头——这是医务室里的最高荣誉。
# en: You find the real injury in minute nine. Late, but not too late. Amaranth's lips thin. "Again tomorrow."
opt.left.say.2 [da92d2] = 你在第九分钟才找到真正的伤员。晚了，但还不算太晚。阿玛兰斯抿紧了嘴唇。“明天再来。”
# en: Work systematically down the line
opt.right.label [7c7311] = 按顺序一个个处理
# en: Methodical, thorough and slow. The real patient waits seven minutes. Amaranth makes you write an essay on why.
opt.right.say.1 [503f17] = 有条不紊、细致而缓慢。真正的病人等了七分钟。阿玛兰斯让你写一篇文章解释为什么。

@event umbral_last_lecture
# en: The Last Lecture on Absence
title [9b0f64] = 关于虚无的最后一课
# en: The Umbral professor draws a star with a hollow centre on the board. "This is not on the syllabus," she says. "Three hundred years ago this academy imprisoned an absence that thinks. I believe you should know that before you graduate."
text [3f5b86] = 暗影理论教授在黑板上画了一颗中心空洞的星星。“这不在教学大纲里，”她说，“三百年前，这所学院囚禁了一个会思考的虚无。我认为你们在毕业前应该知道这件事。”
# en: An Umbral Theory lecture hall lit only by a black candle, the professor drawing a star with a hollow centre on the board.
scene [59edcc] = 暗影理论的讲堂只点着一支黑色蜡烛，教授在黑板上画着一颗中心空洞的星星。
# en: Take careful notes
opt.left.label [4d95af] = 认真记笔记
# en: She speaks for an hour about seals and locks and the founders' fear. At the end she wipes the board clean and says, "This lecture never happened."
opt.left.say.1 [4517c0] = 她讲了一个钟头，关于封印、锁和创始者的恐惧。最后她把黑板擦干净，说：“这堂课从没发生过。”
# en: Ask why she's telling you
opt.right.label [16a97a] = 问她为什么告诉你们
# en: "Because something is stirring," she says, "and the headmistress asked me to find out which of you would ask that question." She writes your name down.
opt.right.say.1 [9e5f65] = “因为有什么东西正在苏醒，”她说，“院长让我看看你们当中谁会问这个问题。”她写下了你的名字。
